WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.972
On a 1–100 chart, what number is one square to the right of 27? Let us think

00:00:05.972 --> 00:00:11.745
carefully. On a standard hundred chart, to the right of 27 is 28. The answer is 28.

00:00:11.745 --> 00:00:12.424
Great work!

00:00:13.283 --> 00:00:18.784
